    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "accept it? how am i supposed to just accept that im losing everything? i feel like such a failure. my family, my life... it's all just such a mess now. it feels like there's just no way to fix this without everything falling apart completely. like it's just better if it would all just stop.",
